Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "id": "urn:R:1",
  "navigate": {
    "datasetId": "urn:goal:1",
    "status": {
      "type": "Property",
      "value": {
        "code": "ACCEPTED"
      }
    },
    "type": "Property",
    "value": {
      "x": 1
    }
  },
  "type": "Robot"
}



07. Goal 1 is still in flight - none of the refused requests touched it
=======================================================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: 365

{
  "id": "urn:R:1",
  "navigate": [
    {
      "type": "Property",
      "value": {
        "x": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "datasetId": "urn:goal:1",
      "status": {
        "type": "Property",
