==========================================================================================================
HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 210

{
  "detail": "attribute 'navigate' has no instance with datasetId 'urn:goal:1' in entity 'urn:R:1'",
  "status": 404,
  "title": "Not Found",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/ResourceNotFound"
}



